    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n1086" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγωγεύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>haulier</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.175
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>escort, guide,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Milet.
				3.152.16
			</span></i> (Methymna, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>prosecutor</i> (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1.4
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>leading-rein, leash</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				974
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Stratt.
				52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				6.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> epith. of
			Zeus, <i>guide, director,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anecd.Stud.
				1.265
			</span></i>.</div>
